# Cursor Rules — Photo Selector Toolbox

## The Five Products
- Desktop (`products/desktop/`): Python + Tkinter
- Android Desktop (`products/android/android-desktop/`): Kotlin + Compose (DeX/tablets)
- PhotoTok (`products/android/phototok/`): Kotlin + Compose (phones < 600 dp)
- Native macOS Desktop (`products/macos-desktop/`): Swift 6 + SwiftUI
- Linux Desktop (`products/linux-desktop/`): Python + GTK4 + Libadwaita

## Core Invariants
1. Identify product first; never leak code across products.
2. Start with `task-lifecycle` skill; end with `retrospective` skill.
3. Verify against local CI mirror: `./scripts/run_tests.sh`.
4. No scratch files in repository.
5. Canonical framework source is `ai/`.
